9. DatetimeOutputParser
Use

Converts LLM output into Python datetime.

Example

Tomorrow at 10 AM

Output

datetime.datetime(...)

Useful for:

Calendar apps
Meeting schedulers
Reminder systems

========

10. EnumOutputParser
Use

Limits answers to predefined values.

Example

Positive
Negative
Neutral

Useful for:

Sentiment Analysis
Email Classification
Ticket Priority

======

11. RegexParser
Use

Extracts structured data using regular expressions.

Example

Input

Invoice Number: INV12345
Amount: ₹5000

Output

{
"invoice":"INV12345",
"amount":"5000"
}

=======

2. RetryOutputParser
Use

If the LLM returns invalid output, it asks the model to regenerate it.

Flow

LLM
 ↓
Invalid JSON
 ↓
Retry Parser
 ↓
Correct JSON

Useful for:

APIs
JSON generation
Automation
13. OutputFixingParser
Use

Automatically fixes malformed output without asking the model to regenerate everything.

Example

Invalid Output

{
name:"Rahul"
age:22
}

Fixed Output

{
"name":"Rahul",
"age":22
}

======

